1
00:00:00,566 --> 00:00:02,096
(Amy:)Well, that's it.

2
00:00:02,168 --> 00:00:04,938
(Amy:)For the next five weeks, we are
officially living together.

3
00:00:05,004 --> 00:00:07,444
(Sheldon:)I guess the experiment begins.

4
00:00:07,506 --> 00:00:08,776
We did it!

5
00:00:08,841 --> 00:00:10,741
Yeah!

6
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:22,040
(Sheldon:)Which side of the bed
would you prefer?

7
00:00:22,109 --> 00:00:23,709
(Amy:)Doesn't matter to me.
Your choice.

8
00:00:23,777 --> 00:00:26,717
(Sheldon:)No, no, we're living together
now-- everything's equal.

9
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:29,150
(Sheldon:)You know? I know that I have
a tendency to be controlling,

10
00:00:29,216 --> 00:00:30,616
(Sheldon:)so I would rather
you choose.

11
00:00:30,684 --> 00:00:32,234
(Amy:)Well, Sheldon,
I really appreciate that,

12
00:00:32,253 --> 00:00:34,583
(Amy:)but these things mean more
to you than they do to me,

13
00:00:34,655 --> 00:00:35,885
(Amy:)so whatever you want.

14
00:00:35,956 --> 00:00:37,396
(Sheldon:)Well, clearly,
it's not whatever I want,

15
00:00:37,424 --> 00:00:39,924
(Sheldon:)because what I want is for you
to make this decision,

16
00:00:39,994 --> 00:00:41,664
(Sheldon:)and you refuse to do that.

17
00:00:41,729 --> 00:00:43,059
(Amy:)Well, I'm not refusing.

18
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:44,900
(Amy:)I'm just trying
to be considerate.

19
00:00:44,965 --> 00:00:46,795
(Sheldon:)Like when you
let me get those shoes

20
00:00:46,867 --> 00:00:48,197
(Sheldon:)with the wheels on the bottom,

21
00:00:48,269 --> 00:00:49,949
(Sheldon:)and then watched me roll
right into traffic?

22
00:00:49,970 --> 00:00:51,300
(Amy:)Sheldon, will you please
just pick a side?

23
00:00:51,322 --> 00:00:58,022
(Sheldon:)Fine.

